== Spawn Mechanics ==
=== Weight ===
{{TA|Sea Creature Weight|}}
Sea Creature Weight is a concept where special numbers are distributed to each sea creature for catch possibility calculations. Sea creatures with higher weight numbers are more likely to be caught up than that of lower weight numbers.

The catch rate for each sea creature can be calculated with this formula: <math>\begin{align}
CatchRate&=\frac{Sea Creature Weight}{Combined Weight Of All Available Sea Creatures}\times 100\%
\end{align}</math><br>
