=== Pools ===
Basic Water Sea Creatures can be caught in most {{Item|Water}}. 
* They are replaced with island pools on {{Zone|Galatea}}, {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}, {{Zone|Backwater Bayou}} and {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.
